Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["0. Introduction", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.976274435054739*^9, 3.9762744542237396`*^9}, {
   3.9762745321428413`*^9, 3.9762745331717167`*^9}, 3.9762745662759724`*^9, {
   3.9762767300274353`*^9, 
   3.976276760565588*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"216254b3-88c9-8942-8f08-\
0ce439574eae"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Welcome to Kansas State! This is a guide originally intended to \
help new physics graduate students become familiar with Mathematica. \
Mathematica is a powerful tool that some professors will require you to use \
for classes. It can also help you in research for things like, plotting, data \
analysis, and other heavy computations. \n\nThis guide is by no means \
extensive, it will mostly cover the basics of syntax and provide some useful \
tips and examples. In the future (hopefully), there will be some more details \
on formatting, styling, and typesetting. Note that this guide was written \
using Wolfram 15.0 on Windows and Linux, so some things may have changed \
depending on what version you are using.  On windows/Linux you can toggle \
fullscreen by pressing ", "Subsubtitle"],
 StyleBox["F12", "Subsubtitle",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 StyleBox[". For Mac OS, the fullscreen toggle is either ", "Subsubtitle"],
 StyleBox["Cmd + Opt + F", "Subsubtitle",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 StyleBox[" or ", "Subsubtitle"],
 StyleBox["Ctrl + Cmd + F", "Subsubtitle",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 StyleBox[".\n\nAnother thing you will want to make sure is enabled is \
Dynamic Updating. This can be found under the Evaluation menu. Ensure that \
the box by ", "Subsubtitle"],
 StyleBox["Dynamic Updating Enabled ", "Subsubtitle",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 StyleBox[" is checked as some of the features in this guide depend on \
Dynamic Updating. It should be on by default, but occasionally Mathematica \
will have run into an error and disable Dynamic Updating, so you may have to \
re-enable it.   \n\nThroughout this guide, there are sections with drop-down \
arrows (", "Subsubtitle"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  GraphicsBox[
   TagBox[RasterBox[CompressedData["
1:eJxTTMoPSmNiYGAo5gASQYnljkVFiZXBAkBOaF5xZnpeaopnXklqemqRRRIz
